    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\n***All applications must be via e-mail to rentals@sfdurcan.ie and must be accompanied by references.***\n\nWelcome to 98 Riverdale Court, a beautifully presented three-bedroom residence enjoying a highly convenient location close to Castlebar Town Centre and the full range of amenities the town has to offer. Freshly decorated from top to bottom and offered to the rental market fully furnished, this bright and inviting home is presented in excellent condition throughout and is ready for immediate occupation.\n\nThe accommodation is well laid out, with comfortable, light-filled living spaces finished in a warm and neutral colour palette. The welcoming living room features attractive timber-style flooring, generous natural light and a contemporary feature fireplace, which creates an appealing focal point within the room. Comfortable furnishings complete this relaxing space, making it ideal for everyday living.\n\nA bright and spacious kitchen and dining area provides an excellent setting for cooking and dining. The kitchen is fitted with a good selection of storage units and worktop space, together with the necessary appliances, while the adjoining dining area benefits from plenty of natural light and offers ample room for a dining table and chairs.\n\nOn the first floor, the property provides three well-proportioned bedrooms, comprising two double bedrooms and a single bedroom. Each room has been freshly decorated and furnished, with large windows allowing for excellent natural light. The bedrooms offer comfortable and practical accommodation, making the property well suited to a variety of living arrangements. A neatly finished shower room, complete with a corner shower enclosure, wash-hand basin and WC, serves the property.\n\nOne of the principal attractions of 98 Riverdale Court is its superbly convenient location. Castlebar Town Centre is within easy reach, placing an excellent selection of shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, schools, leisure facilities and other essential amenities close at hand.\n\nThe property holds a BER rating of C2, offering a good level of energy efficiency and comfort. With its fresh interior, generous accommodation, full complement of furnishings and excellent location, 98 Riverdale Court represents a wonderful opportunity to rent a comfortable and exceptionally convenient home in Castlebar.\n\nThe monthly rent is 1,750. Early viewing is highly recommended. All applications must be via e-mail to rentals@sfdurcan.ie and must be accompanied by references."
      },
